{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1510_doctor_01",
      "hash": "5757b24c2dfc5681",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：……嗯哼！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！祝贺你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1510_doctor_02",
      "hash": "5757af4c2dfc5168",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "历代宝可梦联盟中，\\n每一只在训练家身边\\r\\n大展身手的宝可梦……\\c\\n都会被记录在这个楼层，\\n作为永恒的表彰！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1510_doctor_03",
      "hash": "5757b04c2dfc531b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宝可梦训练家们将这样的表彰\\n称为“登入名人堂”！\\r\\n这是至高无上的喜悦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1510_doctor_04",
      "hash": "5757b54c2dfc5b9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n你在经历了激烈的对决后，\\r\\n成为了联盟冠军！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1510_doctor_05",
      "hash": "5757b64c2dfc5d4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接下来就把[VAR TRNAME(0000)]和\\n宝可梦们的名字也记录于此吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_1510_max",
